{"surah":103,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَصْرِ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نَ لَفِى خُسْرٍ","إِلَّا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ ءَامَنُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> وَعَمِلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَّٰ</span>لِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>تِ وَتَوَاصَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَتَوَاصَوْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>صَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رِ"]}